        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>RFC 9010 - RPL-Unaware Leaves - Page 32</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html { background: #fff; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Noto Serif\", \"Times New Roman\", Georgia, serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 8.5in;\n    min-height: 11in;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 60px 72px 40px 72px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .runhead, .runfoot {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .runhead { border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: 14px; }\n  .runfoot { border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 12px; margin-top: 40px; }\n  .runhead .center, .runfoot .center { flex: 1; text-align: center; }\n  .runhead .right, .runfoot .right { text-align: right; }\n  .content { flex: 1; padding-top: 28px; }\n\n  a { color: #2340c0; text-decoration: none; }\n\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 36px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  h3 {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 30px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  h4 {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 26px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  h2 .num, h3 .num, h4 .num { display: inline-block; margin-right: 14px; }\n\n  p { margin: 12px 0; }\n\n  ul.bullets {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    padding-left: 36px;\n  }\n  ul.bullets > li {\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    text-indent: -14px;\n  }\n  ul.bullets > li::before {\n    content: \"\\2022\";\n    margin-right: 6px;\n  }\n\n  table.reg {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin: 8px auto 4px auto;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    background: #fafafa;\n  }\n  table.reg th, table.reg td {\n    border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;\n    padding: 11px 22px;\n    text-align: left;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  table.reg th { font-weight: normal; }\n\n  .tcaption {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 4px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .table-wrap.t4 { width: 560px; margin: 10px auto 0 auto; }\n  .table-wrap.t5 { width: 470px; margin: 10px auto 0 auto; }\n  .table-wrap table { width: 100%; }\n\n  dl.refs { margin: 14px 0 0 0; }\n  dl.refs > div {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  dl.refs dt {\n    flex: 0 0 150px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding-left: 56px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  dl.refs dd {\n    margin: 0;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"runhead\">\n    <div class=\"left\">RFC 9010</div>\n    <div class=\"center\">RPL-Unaware Leaves</div>\n    <div class=\"right\">April 2021</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <ul class=\"bullets\">\n      <li>The initial allocation is as indicated in <a href=\"#table4\">Table 4</a>:</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"table-wrap t4\">\n      <table class=\"reg\">\n        <tr>\n          <th>Value</th>\n          <th>Meaning</th>\n          <th>Reference</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>0</td>\n          <td>Success / Unqualified acceptance</td>\n          <td>RFC 6550 / RFC 9010</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>1..63</td>\n          <td>Unassigned</td>\n          <td></td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n      <p class=\"tcaption\" id=\"table4\">Table 4: Acceptance Values of the RPL Status</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3><span class=\"num\">12.6.</span>New Subregistry for RPL Rejection Status Values</h3>\n\n    <p>IANA has created a new subregistry for the RPL Rejection Status values for use in the RPL DAO-ACK and DCO messages with the 'A' flag set to 0 and the 'U' flag set to 1, under the \"Routing Protocol for Low Power and Lossy Networks (RPL)\" registry.</p>\n\n    <ul class=\"bullets\">\n      <li>Possible values are 6-bit unsigned integers (0..63).</li>\n      <li>The registration procedure is IETF Review [<a href=\"#RFC8126\">RFC8126</a>].</li>\n      <li>The initial allocation is as indicated in <a href=\"#table5\">Table 5</a>:</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"table-wrap t5\">\n      <table class=\"reg\">\n        <tr>\n          <th>Value</th>\n          <th>Meaning</th>\n          <th>Reference</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>0</td>\n          <td>Unqualified rejection</td>\n          <td>RFC 9010</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>1</td>\n          <td>No routing entry</td>\n          <td>RFC 9009</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>2..63</td>\n          <td>Unassigned</td>\n          <td></td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n      <p class=\"tcaption\" id=\"table5\">Table 5: Rejection Values of the RPL Status</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2><span class=\"num\">13.</span>References</h2>\n\n    <h3><span class=\"num\">13.1.</span>Normative References</h3>\n\n    <dl class=\"refs\">\n      <div>\n        <dt>[RFC2119]</dt>\n        <dd>Bradner, S., \"Key words for use in RFCs to Indicate Requirement Levels\", BCP 14, RFC 2119, DOI 10.17487/RFC2119, March 1997, &lt;<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc2119\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc2119</a>&gt;.</dd>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <dt>[RFC3810]</dt>\n        <dd>Vida, R., Ed. and L. Costa, Ed., \"Multicast Listener Discovery Version 2 (MLDv2) for IPv6\", RFC 3810, DOI 10.17487/RFC3810, June 2004, &lt;<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc3810\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc3810</a>&gt;.</dd>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <dt>[RFC4861]</dt>\n        <dd>Narten, T., Nordmark, E., Simpson, W., and H. Soliman, \"Neighbor Discovery for IP version 6 (IPv6)\", RFC 4861, DOI 10.17487/RFC4861, September 2007, &lt;<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc4861\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc4861</a>&gt;.</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"runfoot\">\n    <div class=\"left\">Thubert &amp; Richardson</div>\n    <div class=\"center\">Standards Track</div>\n    <div class=\"right\">Page 32</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
